  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, lattice existence construction.

    <item>Status: draft; independent source correspondence and mathematical
    review pending.

    <item>Imported Lean source revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>
    (from the repository's <verbatim|source/upstream.json>).

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/rg-multisource.tex>.

    <item>This chapter expands quantitative calculations behind
    <verbatim|Many.usable> and <verbatim|Many.crowd2>; it does not claim to
    prove the upstream estimates that those declarations consume as
    selected-run input.
