  <section|Selected public route><label|selected-public-route>

  The public construction is <verbatim|YM.Independent.constructionRun> in
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Independent/ConstructionRun.lean>. It selects a run with
  <verbatim|R2I.RG05Joint.selectRunWithTreasuryPeriod_preselected_quote_orders_postnumeric>.
  The selected same-run nonlinear step is consumed along
  <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Legato.Run.again>
  (<verbatim|Lean/YM/FullVolume/Cross.lean>) \<rightarrow\>
  <verbatim|YM.FullVolume.ahead> (<verbatim|Lean/YM/FullVolume/Forge.lean>)
  \<rightarrow\> <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Legato.Bandage.paneer>
  (<verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Wax.lean>) \<rightarrow\>
  <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Mallow.Many.ripe>
  (<verbatim|Lean/YM/MergeProof/Tanger.lean>). It is not the nearby
  Cook/Multi route. <verbatim|Many.ripe> invokes <verbatim|Many.usable>,
  <verbatim|Many.crowd2>, and <verbatim|Photo.shade> after producing the
  selected menu plot and field response.

